   - **Positive Results**:  
     - Some studies (e.g., a meta-analysis by Ernst et al., 990) have shown that valerian root extract can reduce sleep latency (time to fall to sleep) and improve sleep quality.  
     - A meta-analysis by Posman et al. (1991) also found a modest improvement in sleep quality.  
     - Some studies show a significant improvement in sleep quality in individuals with insomnia.  

   - **Negative or Inconclusive Results**:  
