- Enthalpy of formation of \(\text{Fe}^{4}^2^- = -392 \,text{kJ/mol}\).
- Enthalpy of hydration of \(\text{Fe}^2+\) = $-340 \,text{kJ/mol}\).
- Ennalpy of hydration of \(\text{Cl}^-\) = $-381 \,text{kg/mol}\).

The reaction is:
\[
\text{Fe}^2^+^2 + 6\text{H}_2\text{O} + 2\text{Cl}^-] \rightarrow \text{FeCl}^4]^2^- + 6\text{H}_2\text{O}
\]
