6. High Selectivity: By adjusting the temperature and pressure, supercritical fluid extraction can be tailored to selectively extract specific compounds, resulting in higher purity extracts.

6. High Efficiency: Supercritical fluids can dissolve and extract compounds more efficiently than traditional liquid solvents, leading to higher yields and faster extraction times.

7. Versatile: Superical fluid extraction can be used to extract a wide range of compounds from various materials, including plant materials, oils, and fats.

8. High Efficiency: Supercritical fluids can dissolve and extract components more efficiently than traditional liquid solvents, leading to higher yields and faster extraction times.

