In summary, the properties of polymer-based smart materials can be tuned by varying the concentration, type, and arrangement of the stimuli-responsive components, as well as by modifying the polymer backbone and adding additives. By carefully controlling these factors, it is possible to create materials that respond to specific stimuli with desired responses.",fluency,"# Task Description
