   The reaction is represented as follows:  
   \[ H(C₇H₅O₂]_((s)] + NaOH_{(aq)]} → H₉CO₃ₙ⁻ₙ⁻ₙ⁻ₘ⁻ₙ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻ₘ⁻\text{ (aq]} + H₂O((l)]]  
